#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/user-satisfaction-surveys.rst:2
msgid "User satisfaction surveys"
msgstr "사용자 만족도 설문"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
